SUMMARY:Mid-Summer North Raleigh Pool Party!
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nWhat: Mid-Summer N
 orth Raleigh Pool Party\nWhen: Friday June 26th\, 6:30pm\nWhere: Address w
 ill be shared upon RSVP\nLet’s escape the heat! Summer will be in full s
 wing so let’s enjoy our favorite North Raleigh pool again.\nBring a dish
  to share!\nFeel free to bring a friend or two.\nBYOB- No glass!!!\nPlease
  Carpool! Parking is limited!\nOrganizer: Dwen Andrews dwencita@gmail.com 
 919 624 0762 / 919 244 2710 LE2613
