BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Raleigh & Triangle Activities
UID:event_315360318@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260625T042121Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260627T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260627T140000
SUMMARY:The Peace Forge: Igniting Sparks of Peace to Co-Create a Better Wo
 rld
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n**FREE online summ
 it event!** Are you tired of the anger\, chaos and divisiveness that has t
 aken over our society?\n\n**Join The Peace Forge and help us "Ignite Spark
 s of Peace to Co-Create a Better World"**\n\nWe are all sparks of the divi
 ne!\nWhat's more\, SPARK is our acronym for:\n\n**S** = suicide prevention
  (epidemic self-harm shows how much the world needs us!)\n**P** = particip
 ating in open dialogue\n**A** = addressing society causes\n**R** = rejuven
 ate Mind\, Body\, Spirit\n**K** = kindness toward All\n\n(Sign up here on 
 meetup AND please fully register at http://peacepartners.net to get all yo
 ur FREE materials including the zoom password)\n\nCan WE do more to create
  the peace we want to see in the world?\n\nFrom our perspective\, the answ
 er is YES! And we're excited to share real tools\, techniques and ideas wi
 th YOU - on Saturday\, June 27th\, 2026 - from 10 AM to 2 PM US East Coast
  Time!\n\nThis event is not for everybody. We're looking for people who wa
 nt to take **ACTION** \\- and be part of a **SOLUTION**! (or MANY solution
 s!)\n\nAre you in business with part of the solution?\n\nDo you have an id
 ea and WANT to be in business?\n\nAre you just ready to volunteer some tim
 e and help us make an IMPACT on creating more peace in the world?\n\nBring
  your skills\, ideas and enthusiasm to be part of this unique event! Whoev
 er is here will be involved in brainstorming and creating 3 MORE events - 
 based on what YOU bring to the table! (YES! Your ideas will be heard!)\n\n
 Remember - you're not fully registered until you click http://peacepartner
 s.net and fill out the registration form - you'll need the password to joi
 n us on Zoom!\n\nNOTE: if you're local to the Raleigh NC area\, the same e
 vening we're having a Mystic Picnic potluck dinner at Lake Crabtree park\,
  a great time to meet myself (Carl) and others\, see https://www.meetup.co
 m/inner-selves-for-outer-mastery/events/315251228/\n\n**Peace Forge Speake
 rs Include:**\nCarl Johann Schroeder "Peace Consciousness: Positive versus
  Negative Judgments"\nMaggie Burgisser "Peaceful Living with Feng Shui & E
 ssential Oils"\nAinslie Kincross "Emotion Code/Body Code as a Path to Emot
 ional Peace"\nTom Cullen "Inspired Music for Peace"\nGail Dixon "Create Yo
 ur Ripple"\nShavonne Gibson "Forging Peace: The Journey from Self-Rejectio
 n to Wholeness"\nTawnya Perry "The Cost of Dysregulation as it Relates to 
 Family Peace"\nLinda Grace Farley "Communication Intelligence for the Fami
 ly: Building Peace\, One Conversation at a Time"\nAndrea Randle: "Who Move
 d My Peace? Peace is a Practiced Response"\nRichard Mabe "Four Steps to Un
 breakable Peace"\nSheyenne & Don Kreamer "Connect. Collaborate. Create. : 
 A Formula for Creating Peaceful Communities"\nDarlene Sartore "Urantia's P
 eacekeeping Chaplain's Corps"
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/raleigh-triangle-activities/events/31
 5360318/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260621T223610Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260621T223610Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Raleigh & Triangle Activities
UID:event_315396986@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260625T042121Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260627T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260627T193000
SUMMARY:Mystic Picnic Dinner! in-person\, Raleigh area\, last Saturdays
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nNOTE: June 27 Myst
 ic Picnic is an evening potluck 5pm-730pm (sunset is 830pm) rather than th
 e usual lunch time\, because Carl will be a presenter in a wonderful onlin
 e peace summit from 10am-2pm so check that out here: https://www.meetup.co
 m/inner-selves-for-outer-mastery/events/315249014/\n\nDo you enjoy spiritu
 al growth? Are you having amazing experiences that you can’t talk about 
 with most people? Join the club!\n\nEvery last Saturday at the Mystic Picn
 ic from March to October\, we create a safe fun outdoor space for meeting 
 kindred souls and clarifying the concepts that set us free in these ascens
 ion times when the realities are so clearly diverging. Which parallel Eart
 h are you from\, and what are you here to do?\n\nWe share stories and supp
 ort energy healing\, psychic gifts\, angels\, nature spirits\, ET helpers\
 , reincarnation\, lucid dreams\, and so much more. We keep it real\, groun
 ded\, positive\, and heart-centered\, so folks can bring their genuine con
 cerns without the big conspiracies. I’ve experienced so many wonders mys
 elf\, so I’ll be hosting a main circle for friendly discussions. There w
 ill be potluck food and a nice grassy field for activities.\n\nBring a cha
 ir if you have\, plus food or drink you want to share. I’ll supply cups\
 , plates\, napkins and utensils\, plus extra chairs and snacks. We meet at
  Lake Crabtree park off Route 40 between Durham and Raleigh\, NC. Enter pa
 rk from Aviation Parkway\, proceed to first parking lot on right. If lot i
 s full\, drive to the next lot and walk back\, or wait as people come and 
 go frequently. You’ll see me with some chairs near the lot (I’ll get t
 he best spot available)\n\nRe-member. You matter. Time and space are ritua
 ls. You decide your own future. Your imagination is the doorway. Your cons
 ciousness creates your own reality.\n\n"I was alive and I waited for this.
  Right here\, right now\, there is no other place I wanna be. Watching the
  world wake up from history."\n\\-\\- Jesus Jones video: [https://www.yout
 ube.com/watch?v=GNJpLU8qcx8](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GNJpLU8qcx8)\
 n\n"There's a starman waiting in the sky. He's told us not to blow it 'cau
 se he knows it's all worthwhile."\n\\-\\- astral David Bowie saves the wor
 ld in January's stunning 10 year tribute video: [https://www.youtube.com/w
 atch?v=ZcC0QWsfpAQ](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZcC0QWsfpAQ)\n\nMy nam
 e is Carl and I’m cross-posting this event in several meetups for maximu
 m networking fun. To see our spiritual meetup events [www.meetup.com/inner
 -selves-for-outer-mastery/](http://www.meetup.com/inner-selves-for-outer-m
 astery/) YouTube channel [https://www.youtube.com/@InnerSelvesMastery](htt
 ps://www.youtube.com/@InnerSelvesMastery) and newsletter [www.SignupISM.co
 m](http://www.SignupISM.com) Everyone is welcome to also join and post the
 ir own spiritual community events at [https://www.meetup.com/starseedsofra
 leigh/](https://www.meetup.com/starseedsofraleigh/)\n\nbest wishes\,\nCarl
  Johann Schroeder\nSpiritual Teaching and Life Coaching\n[www.InnerSelvesM
 astery.com](http://www.InnerSelvesMastery.com)\nquick links: [www.SignupIS
 M.com](http://www.SignupISM.com)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/raleigh-triangle-activities/events/31
 5396986/
